<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh bourses closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh bourses closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh's bourses - the main Dhaka Stock Exchange (DSE) and the Chittagong Stock Exchange - were closed on Thursday for the May Day national holiday.</p>
<p>The DSE all-share price index rose 21.91 points or 2.34 percent at 957.48 on a trunover of 55.1 million taka on Wednesday. The market will reopen on Saturday after the Moslem Friday weekend.</p>
<p>-- Dhaka Newsroom +880-2-506363</p>
</text>
